{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：13:16 2026-09-13 HKT</p>\n\n<p>韓國男團TREASURE登陸香港開騷，昨晚（9月12日）於亞博Arena舉行《TREASURE THE STAGE 2026 NEW WAV: LIVE IN HK》演唱會。演唱會約於6時開始，未開騷現場已坐滿入場觀眾且全院滿座，值得一提的是，入場觀眾9成9都是女性，可見這隊韓國男團TREASURE在亞太區有多受歡迎。</p>\n<h2>TREASURE跳唱《IF I》、《ZOOM ZOOM》開場</h2>\n<p>甫一開場，他們以《IF I》、《ZOOM ZOOM》兩首快歌開場，其中有一段Jihoon和Doyoung以普通話唱出周杰倫的《告白氣球》，令全場粉絲尖叫。其後又分別唱了《KING KONG》、《I WANT YOUR LOVE》、《사랑해》、《MY TREASURE》等幾首冧歌。</p>\n<img alt=\"（左起）尹材赫、蘇庭煥、Asahi、朴炡禹高歌《Replay》 。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/431e1a61a11746bcdea24ae7ec57db4f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_44_06.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朴志焄、金道榮合唱周杰倫的《告白氣球》 。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/25e39eb272153cc0ed7d0d59c100cc68/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_44_03_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"金道榮、尹材赫、志焄歎蛋撻。    \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/307e393eea74d39335107f10762641dd/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_44_02_1__1.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE同歌迷傾吓偈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/d1b96d04a565b27610fd16da8153dc76/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_30.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"昨晚（9月12日）於亞博Arena舉行《TREASURE THE STAGE 2026 NEW WAV: LIVE IN HK》演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/88ce3027cf99b747ac425f9f85b2924a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_31.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE登陸香港開騷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/bf4ea5c9ce53af0eca4e95376e75e19e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_40_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"演唱會約於6時開始，未開騷現場已坐滿入場觀眾且全院滿座。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b65b156052598644302de32b8a6428ac/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_40.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE在亞太區大受歡迎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/0863873d77dddea92fa8ecb72b45278d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_41_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE分別唱《KING KONG》、《I WANT YOUR LOVE》等幾首冧歌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/288d86303ac4822d3bc7d28faa6676f5/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_41.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE唱《사랑해》、《MY TREASURE》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/066e0463bafbf858ec75ddb940d1e786/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_42.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"落力跳唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/62cb82c5edd951e6e8ca52a37d1c5a74/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_43.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"入場觀眾9成9都是女性。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/182489f37cd7b9d5588e33b3f6f139c9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_44_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE亞博落力跳唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1fd139e3117228a881ce743ae51a6f97/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_45_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE企鐵籠近距離寵粉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/2e76e15bb3658a8fee5e3cd847bb23be/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_53.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"入場觀眾9成9是女歌迷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/4cdfd4407a793f95a6aff4991e510045/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_54_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE居高臨下冧歌迷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9637365331f283146057735f0a18d293/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_54.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE約定再來港開騷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/60bc22beb811d74c5e66e0154a1456db/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_55.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"講吓廣東話、韓文，又講吓普通話。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/040db7959c371bb0efb5ac16dd313fbc/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_57_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/2d5981ad3154d7fa5c4720a78536d685/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_42_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE亞博落力跳唱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a130e94f04b45b6bad66c8c393e99dd1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_43_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"講吓廣東話、韓文，又講吓普通話。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/aad098efe4ec1bbdff14d0f999ccb2f2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_50_1__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE約定再來港開騷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/d0997751fd70e55fb02847e697f2a8b3/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_51_1__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"講吓廣東話、韓文，又講吓普通話冧歌迷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/8853e38be25132f0ec0c21bb49763d9a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_57_2__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"施展渾身解數~\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/8be62a2fe2c5cdbe4294a0f65d13744a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_59_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"值得一提的是，入場觀眾9成9都是女性。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/5b8285e5292f7343dc0ed7083a3ef105/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_59_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE在亞太區大受歡迎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6df4162848bdb197798695842b11ad3e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_43_59.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TREASURE登陸香港開騷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/08a1c777d4645ecafccd2d8b4d5e9d80/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_44_00.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"昨晚（9月12日）於亞博Arena舉行《TREASURE THE STAGE 2026 NEW WAV: LIVE IN HK》演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/f1205858cd23a0b8a56b2111a40577b0/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-12_at_22_44_01_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>TREASURE居高臨下冧歌迷</h2>\n<p>在互動環節中，Doyoung用普通話冧曬「冧功」講「我愛你」又清唱《告白氣球》，更被成員爆為了當晚演唱練習了相當久。除了唱歌、跳舞，有成員大爆他在練習了很久，就算在之前飛往日本的飛機上都在練習。另一環節中，TREASURE成員也和粉絲玩遊戲，讓粉絲挑選「與他們去約會的地點」，也有經典的估歌仔環節「We Are YG Family」，成員分別兩組鬥快估歌，估中的一組唱跳一段，令氣氛十分高漲，最後勝出一隊獎勵為食蛋撻，輸的一隊則跳可愛的tiktok舞。最後環節中，TREASURE成員坐在花車上巡遊一圈。來到Encore環節，成員們更high爆企上第一排前的欄杆，與粉絲近距離互動。TREASURE最後跟Fans約定會再來港演出，說：「我們今晚製造了很多美好回憶。」</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T05:38:52.905452+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":708,"images":28,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}